          <div class="article-body">
            <p></p><h3>Sim-Wide Engine Upgrade v2.1</h3><p></p><p>All terminal scripts, tribute adapters, and titler endpoints across Control &amp; Chaos have been refactored for maximum region performance during high-capacity events.</p><p></p><h3>Changes &amp; Optimizations</h3><p></p><p></p><ul><li><strong>LinksetData Memory Caching</strong>: Replaced synchronous HTTP database lookups with native LinksetData key-value caching.</li><br><li><strong>Asynchronous Experience KVP Backing</strong>: Profile stats and XP totals now commit asynchronously in the background, eliminating script execution pauses.</li><br><li><strong>Memory Audits</strong>: Over 25KB free memory per module with zero region time dilation, even during 50+ avatar club events.</li></ul><p></p>
